From: mabn <github@mabn.pl>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:09:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [barreplay] P10: the fighters' enemy-aircraft searches
 launched at the slow-update slice's start and run on P4's workers ahead of it
 (toggle2 0x1000000)

The slow update takes a precomputed answer when its arguments are bitwise the
predicted ones and no drain happened since the launch (and draws the synced
tempNum the search would have); otherwise it searches itself. The search on a
pool thread walks the same quads, teams and lists with the same filter and
closest rule, marking units with the thread's own numbers. Entering the crash
state drains (the search reads the crash bit).
